<!--
  Privacy manifest for Shared.framework (iOS).

  SCOPE: required-reason API declarations only. NSPrivacyTracking,
  NSPrivacyTrackingDomains and NSPrivacyCollectedDataTypes are deliberately
  ABSENT rather than declared empty, because the data-flow evidence for this
  build is not yet complete. Omission is not a claim of "none"; see the
  handback report for the exact unresolved fields.

  SOURCE MAPPING (first-party code compiled into Shared-iOS):

    NSPrivacyAccessedAPICategoryUserDefaults -> 1C8F.1
      UserDefaults(suiteName: AppConstants.AppGroupID), shared with the app
      and its app extensions via the App Group container:
        Settings/SettingsStore.swift:10
        Environment/Environment.swift:370
        Environment/AppConstants.swift:357
        LiveActivity/LiveActivityRegistry.swift:595,600,607
        LiveActivity/LocalPush/LiveActivityPendingEnd.swift:29,40,53
        LiveActivity/LocalPush/LiveActivityPendingStart.swift:101,112,126
      Notifications/LocalPush/UserDefaultsValueSync.swift resolves its store to
      Current.settingsStore.prefs (the same App Group suite) when no explicit
      UserDefaults is injected.

    CA92.1 is NOT declared here: no app-exclusive UserDefaults access is
    compiled into Shared-iOS. Environment/WatchUserDefaults.swift uses a bare
    UserDefaults() (standard suite) but is a member of Shared-watchOS only.

    NSPrivacyAccessedAPICategoryDiskSpace is NOT declared: the only first-party
    caller (Environment/DeviceWrapper.swift volumes + the StorageSensor that
    consumes it) is excluded from every build product by the
    WOOWTECH_ENABLE_STORAGE_SENSOR compilation boundary.
    This is a SOURCE-LEVEL result; compiled/package/SDK coverage has not been
    verified in this lane.

    FileTimestamp, SystemBootTime and ActiveKeyboards: no first-party matches
    found in Sources/**. Source-level only; not a binary-level guarantee.
-->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>NSPrivacyAccessedAPITypes</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>NSPrivacyAccessedAPIType</key>
